      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Night of the Demons spawned two direct sequels and a 2009 remake, but its real impact is seen in films like Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight (1995) and The Demons of Ludlow (1983). Its blend of possession horror and teen comedy influenced modern films like <a href=\"/movie/19994\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"19994\">Jennifer's Body</a> (2009) and Hell Fest (2018). The Hull House party sequence set the template for countless \"teens party in wrong place\" horror films of the 1990s and beyond."
      }
